# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local virtual environments - never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Env/
For_Test/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documentation and third-party reference repositories (local only, not pushed)
#
#   docs/            this project's own notes (分配.md, 算法开源项目.md,
#                    reference/*.md = third-party project teardowns)
#   docs/repo/       cloned third-party projects (image_process / Algo /
#                    Bullet / Camera), ~1.4 GB, each with its own licence
#
#   These are working material and are deliberately kept out of the pushed
#   tree.  Licence status of every reference project:
#   core/bullet_sim/docs/OPEN_SOURCE_REFERENCES.md
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: keep this root-anchored - a bare `docs/` also swallows the package's
# own core/bullet_sim/docs/ directory.
/docs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Module outputs - one folder per module under data/, plus generated artifacts
#
#   data/bullet_sim/   platform results (datasets, benchmark JSON reports)
#   data/cpu/          CPU decision results
#   data/fpga/         FPGA results
#   data/vision/       image-processing results
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/
/benchmarks_output/
*.npz
*.npy
*.bin
*.dat

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Archives / Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
